ll-ferrell/umc.cpc.75i7cwezyw4wq28ci4epzre4w","subtitle":"Writer","description":""}],"collection":null,"about":[{"title":"Talladega Nights: The Ballad of Ricky Bobby","description":"The fastest man on four wheels, Ricky Bobby (Will Ferrell) is one of the greatest drivers in NASCAR history. A big, hairy American winning machine, Ricky has everything a dimwitted daredevil could want, a luxurious mansion, a smokin' hot wife (Leslie Bibb) and all the fast food he can eat. But Ricky's turbo-charged lifestyle hits an unexpected speed bump when he's bested by flamboyant Euro-idiot Jean Girard (Sacha Baron Cohen, TV's \"Da Ali G Show\") and reduced to a fear-ridden wreck. Losing his wife and job to best bud and fellow fool, Cal Naughton, Jr. (John C. Reilly), Ricky must kick some serious asphalt if he's to get his career back on the track, beat Girard and reclaim his fame and fortune. 'Cause as Ricky Bobby always says, if you ain't first, you're last!","genres":["Comedy","Sports"]}],"info":[{"title":"Information","items":[{"title":"Studio","info":"Columbia Pictures"},{"title":"Released","info":"2006"},{"title":"Run Time","info":"1 hr 47 min"},{"title":"Rated","info":"PG-13 for crude and sexual humor, language, drug references and brief comic violence."},{"title":"Content Advisories","info":"Violence, Language, Sexual Content, Suggestive Dialogue"},{"title":"Region of Origin","info":"United States"},{"title":null,"info":"© 2006 Columbia Pictures Industries, Inc. and GH One LLC. All Rights Reserved."}]},{"title":"Languages","items":[{"title":"Original Audio","info":"English, English (United Kingdom), French, French (France)"},{"title":"Audio","info":"English (AAC, ⁨Dolby 5.1⁩), Spanish (Latin America) (AAC)"},{"title":"Subtitles","info":"English (CC), Spanish (Latin America) "}]},{"title":"Accessibility","items":[{"title":"(cc)","info":"Closed captions (CC) refer to subtitles in the available language with the addition of relevant non-dialogue information."}]}]}